  "description": "Manage MikroTik RouterOS devices from .NET. Includes both the low-level ADO.NET-like API and the high-level O/R mapper with 169 ready-made entities, over 12 transports: binary API, API-SSL, REST, Telnet, SSH, MAC-Telnet and WinBox (CLI and native-M2, over IP or MAC layer). The O/R mapper was previously distributed separately as tik4net.objects / tik4net.entities; since 4.0 it is part of this package.",
